        42.711456298828125,
        91.79353332519531,
        437.9490966796875,
        103.5147705078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that is necessary in the MMH update can be bypassed. Again, sampling from pθ.x1:T |y1:T / is",
