        164.3615264892578,
        438.22418212890625,
        173.59686279296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PMCMC update called the conditional SMC update. This update is similar to a standard SMC",
      "bbox": [
        42.71004104614258,
        176.31666564941406,
        438.2321472167969,
        185.552001953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "algorithm but is such that a prespeciﬁed path X1:T with ancestral lineage B1:T is ensured to",
